      "text": "Q1 - Basic Global Error Handler + 404 (Easy)",
      "originalText": "Q1 - Basic Global Error Handler + 404 (Easy)",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "a2"
    },
    {
      "id": "text3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 145,
      "width": 648,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 119118835,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 345361922,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795164735110,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Create an Express app with routes:\n   GET /          -> returns \"OK\"\n   GET /crash     -> throws new Error(\"Something broke\")\n2. Add a 404 handler for any unknown route that forwards\n   an error (status 404, \"Route not found\") using next(err).\n3. Write ONE global error middleware (err, req, res, next)\n   at the END of the app that responds with JSON:\n   { success: false, status: <code>, message: <msg> }\n   - Use err.statusCode or default to 500.\nTest: /crash -> 500,  /abc -> 404.",
      "originalText": "1. Create an Express app with routes:\n   GET /          -> returns \"OK\"\n   GET /crash     -> throws new Error(\"Something broke\")\n2. Add a 404 handler for any unknown route that forwards\n   an error (status 404, \"Route not found\") using next(err).\n3. Write ONE global error middleware (err, req, res, next)\n   at the END of the app that responds with JSON:\n   { success: false, status: <code>, message: <msg> }\n   - Use err.statusCode or default to 500.\nTest: /crash -> 500,  /abc -> 404.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "a3"
    },
