      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Q2 - Custom AppError Class (Medium)",
      "originalText": "Q2 - Custom AppError Class (Medium)",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "a5"
    },
    {
      "id": "text6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 505,
      "width": 712.8,
      "height": 247.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 554650867,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 945059678,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795164735111,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Create class AppError extends Error with\n   statusCode, status ('fail' for 4xx, 'error' for 5xx),\n   and isOperational = true.\n2. Route GET /users/:id (use an in-memory array):\n   - id not a number  -> next(new AppError(\"Invalid id\", 400))\n   - user not found   -> next(new AppError(\"User not found\", 404))\n3. Update the global handler:\n   - NODE_ENV=development -> send message + err.stack\n   - NODE_ENV=production  -> operational errors: send message\n                             unknown/bug errors: log it and send\n                             500 \"Something went wrong\" ",
      "originalText": "1. Create class AppError extends Error with\n   statusCode, status ('fail' for 4xx, 'error' for 5xx),\n   and isOperational = true.\n2. Route GET /users/:id (use an in-memory array):\n   - id not a number  -> next(new AppError(\"Invalid id\", 400))\n   - user not found   -> next(new AppError(\"User not found\", 404))\n3. Update the global handler:\n   - NODE_ENV=development -> send message + err.stack\n   - NODE_ENV=production  -> operational errors: send message\n                             unknown/bug errors: log it and send\n                             500 \"Something went wrong\" ",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "a6"
    },
