      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Q3 - Async Errors + Specific Error Types (Hard)",
      "originalText": "Q3 - Async Errors + Specific Error Types (Hard)",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "a8"
    },
    {
      "id": "text9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 890,
      "width": 615.6,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 832386178,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 453621058,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795164735111,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Write a catchAsync(fn) wrapper so async route handlers\n   forward rejected promises to the global handler\n   (no try/catch in routes).\n2. Route POST /orders (async, uses express.json()):\n   - missing \"item\" in body -> throw AppError 400\n   - simulate DB failure with await Promise.reject(...)\n3. In the global handler, map special errors:\n   - Malformed JSON body (SyntaxError, err.type ===\n     'entity.parse.failed') -> 400 \"Invalid JSON\"\n   - err.name === 'ValidationError' -> 422\n   - err.name === 'JsonWebTokenError' -> 401\n4. Add process.on('unhandledRejection') and\n   process.on('uncaughtException') to log & shut down\n   the server gracefully.",
      "originalText": "1. Write a catchAsync(fn) wrapper so async route handlers\n   forward rejected promises to the global handler\n   (no try/catch in routes).\n2. Route POST /orders (async, uses express.json()):\n   - missing \"item\" in body -> throw AppError 400\n   - simulate DB failure with await Promise.reject(...)\n3. In the global handler, map special errors:\n   - Malformed JSON body (SyntaxError, err.type ===\n     'entity.parse.failed') -> 400 \"Invalid JSON\"\n   - err.name === 'ValidationError' -> 422\n   - err.name === 'JsonWebTokenError' -> 401\n4. Add process.on('unhandledRejection') and\n   process.on('uncaughtException') to log & shut down\n   the server gracefully.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "a9"
    },
